<rml>
<head><title>CCCaster</title><link type="text/rcss" href="launcher.rcss" /></head>
<body>
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">C</span><div><h1>CCCaster <span>verB</span></h1><p>MELTY BLOOD Actress Again Current Code</p></div></div>
  <span id="version" class="version"></span>
</header>
<div class="shell">
  <nav aria-label="メインメニュー">
    <button class="nav-item active" data-page="matching" aria-current="page" id="nav-matching"><span class="nav-number">01</span><span data-en="Matching">マッチング</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="spectate" id="nav-spectate"><span class="nav-number">02</span><span data-en="Spectate">観戦</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="training" id="nav-training"><span class="nav-number">03</span><span data-en="Training">トレーニング</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="offline" id="nav-offline"><span class="nav-number">04</span><span data-en="Offline versus">オフライン対戦</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="replay" id="nav-replay"><span class="nav-number">05</span><span data-en="Replay">リプレイ観戦</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="controller" id="nav-controller"><span class="nav-number">06</span><span data-en="Controllers">コントローラ設定</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-page="guide" id="nav-guide"><span class="nav-number">07</span><span data-en="How to play">操作ガイド</span></button>
    <div class="nav-bottom"><button id="language" class="quiet">English</button></div>
  </nav>
  <main id="content">
    <div id="loading" class="notice" role="status" data-en="Preparing the launcher…">ランチャーを準備しています…</div>
    <div id="error" class="notice error hidden" role="alert"></div>
    <div id="incoming-banner" class="notice incoming hidden"><div><strong data-en="Incoming match request">対戦の申し込みが届いています</strong></div><button id="show-requests" data-en="View requests">申し込みを確認</button><button id="dismiss-notice" class="quiet" data-en="Dismiss">閉じる</button></div>

    <section class="page" id="page-matching">
      <div class="page-heading matching-heading"><div><h2 data-en="Matching">マッチング</h2></div></div>
      <div class="tabs matching-tabs" role="tablist"><button id="matching-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-en="Public matching">公開マッチング</button><button id="direct-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-en="Direct connection">直接接続</button></div>
        <div id="requests-card" class="card request-card hidden"><h3 data-en="Incoming requests">届いた申し込み</h3><div id="requests"></div></div>
        <div id="outgoing" class="card hidden"><p id="outgoing-text"></p><button id="cancel-request" data-en="Cancel request">申し込みを取り消す</button></div>
        <button id="cancel-pairing" data-en="Cancel pairing" class="hidden">成立確認を中止</button>
        <p id="matching-notice" class="subtle hidden" role="status"></p><p id="matching-error" class="error-text hidden"></p>
      <div id="matching-panel" role="tabpanel">
        <div class="matching-layout">
          <div id="public-directory" class="card directory-card">
            <div class="directory-heading"><div class="card-title"><h3 data-en="Public matching list">公開マッチング一覧</h3><span id="people-count" class="count-badge"></span></div><div class="directory-status"><span class="subtle" data-en="Newest first · time listed (h:mm)">新着順・募集からの経過（時:分）</span><span id="service-status" class="pill" role="status"></span></div></div>
            <p id="incomplete" class="error-text hidden" data-en="The history limit was reached; this list may be incomplete.">取得上限に達したため、一覧は一部のみです。</p>
            <div id="people-window" class="people-window"><div id="people"></div></div>
            <div class="pagination"><button id="prev" data-en="Previous">前へ</button><span id="page-count"></span><button id="next" data-en="Next">次へ</button></div>
            <div class="player-selection"><p id="selected-player" class="subtle"></p><p id="selected-result" class="error-text hidden"></p><div class="selection-actions"><button id="invite-selected" data-en="Request a match">対戦申し込み</button><button id="watch-selected" data-en="Watch / stand by">観戦・待機</button></div></div>
            <p class="directory-note" data-en="Listed players may be in a match. --:-- means the listing time is unknown.">掲載中でも対戦中の場合があります。時刻不明は --:--。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card registration" id="registration-card">
            <h3 id="standby-title">公開で対戦を待つ</h3>
            <div class="standby-profile"><span id="matching-profile-image" class="profile-mark"><img id="matching-emblem" class="hidden" width="48" height="24" aria-label="プレイヤー画像" src="emblem:0" /><span id="matching-emblem-placeholder">P</span></span><div class="standby-profile-details"><div class="profile-name-row"><strong id="matching-name"></strong><button id="profile-settings" data-page="settings" class="quiet" data-en="Profile &amp; settings">プロフィール・設定</button></div><p id="matching-status" class="subtle" role="status"></p></div></div>
            <p id="visibility-help" class="subtle"></p>
            <div id="registration-start"><label class="check"><input id="training-standby" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Train while waiting">トレーニング待ち受け</span></label><button id="start-matching" class="primary standby-start">公開マッチング待機開始</button><details id="matching-options"><summary id="matching-options-toggle" class="summary" data-en="Connection options">接続オプション</summary><label><span data-en="UDP port">接続ポート</span><input id="matching-port" type="text" min="1" max="65535" value="7500" /></label></details></div>
            <div id="registration-active" class="hidden"><span id="registration-visibility" class="pill"></span><div class="code-line"><strong id="matching-code" class="code"></strong><button id="copy-matching" data-en="Copy code">コードをコピー</button></div><p class="subtle" data-en="Share this code for matches or spectating.">対戦・観戦に使えるコードです。</p><label class="check"><input id="pause-matching" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Pause incoming requests">受付を一時停止</span></label><button id="switch-visibility" class="standby-switch hidden"></button><button id="stop-matching" class="quiet standby-stop" data-en="End standby">待機を終了</button></div>
            <p id="other-mode" class="subtle hidden" data-en="Incoming matches are paused while another mode is running.">別モードの実行中は対戦の受付を休止しています。</p>
            <button id="retry-cleanup" class="quiet hidden" data-en="Cancel leftover listings">残った自分の募集を取り消す</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="direct-panel" role="tabpanel" class="hidden">
        <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Connect with a code">接続コードで対戦</h3><p id="end-matching-hint" class="subtle hidden" data-en="You can request a matching code while listed. End standby before direct hosting, direct connections, or port changes.">マッチングコードへの申し込みは可能です。直接接続・待受やポート変更は、待機を終了してから行ってください。</p>
          <fieldset id="direct-fields"><label><span data-en="Connection code">接続コード</span><input id="direct-code" maxlength="511" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" /></label><label class="port"><span data-en="Local UDP port">接続ポート</span><input id="direct-port" type="text" min="1" max="65535" value="7500" /></label>
          <p class="subtle" data-en="Enter your opponent’s code, or leave blank to host.">相手のコードを入力。空欄なら自分で待ち受けます。</p>
          <button id="start-direct" class="primary" data-en="Connect / host">接続・待受を開始</button></fieldset>
          <p id="direct-lookup" class="subtle hidden" role="status" data-en="Checking the connection code…">接続コードを確認しています…</p>
          <p class="subtle" data-en="Your opponent can see your IP address.">接続相手にIPアドレスが伝わります。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page hidden" id="page-spectate">
      <div class="page-heading"><h2 data-en="Spectate">観戦</h2></div>
      <div class="card feature"><p data-en="Enter either player’s code. If the match has not started, you will wait for it.">どちらかの対戦者のコードを入力してください。対戦前なら開始まで待機します。</p>
        <label><span data-en="Spectator code">観戦コード</span><input id="spectator-code" maxlength="255" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" /></label>
        <button id="watch" class="primary launch" data-en="Watch / stand by">観戦する・開始まで待機</button>
        <p class="subtle" data-en="Both players must allow spectators. Up to 8 viewers.">観戦には対戦者双方の許可が必要です（最大8人）。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="page hidden" id="page-training">
      <div class="page-heading"><h2 data-en="Training">トレーニング</h2><span class="pill" data-en="Offline">オフライン</span></div>
      <div class="card feature"><p data-en="Practice as Player 1.">1Pで練習を始めます。</p><button id="training" class="primary launch" data-en="Start training">トレーニングを開始</button>
        <div class="tips"><p><kbd>F4</kbd><span data-en="Controller settings">コントローラ設定</span></p><p><kbd>Ctrl + 0–8</kbd><span data-en="Input delay">入力ディレイの変更</span></p><p><kbd>F1</kbd><span data-en="Cycle information display">情報表示の切替</span></p><p><kbd>FN1 / FN2</kbd><span data-en="Save / load a practice state">練習状態の保存／読込み</span></p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="page hidden" id="page-offline">
      <div class="page-heading"><h2 data-en="Offline versus">オフライン対戦</h2><span class="pill" data-en="Local 2 players">同じPCで2人対戦</span></div>
      <div class="card feature"><p data-en="Play as Player 1 and Player 2 on this PC. No connection code is needed.">同じPCで1P・2Pを操作して対戦します。接続コードは不要です。</p>
        <button id="offline" class="primary launch" data-en="Start offline versus">オフライン対戦を開始</button>
                    <p class="subtle" data-en="Assign each player's controls in Controller settings or press F4 on the character select screen.">コントローラ設定、またはキャラ選択画面のF4で、1P・2Pそれぞれの操作を割り当ててください。</p>
        <div class="tips"><p><kbd>START / F1</kbd><span data-en="Character select: delay, background and display settings">キャラ選択：ディレイ・背景・表示の設定</span></p><p><kbd>START</kbd><span data-en="In battle: pause menu">対戦中：ポーズメニュー</span></p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="page hidden" id="page-replay">
      <div class="page-heading"><h2 data-en="Replay">リプレイ観戦</h2></div>
      <div class="card feature"><p data-en="Choose a saved match in the game’s replay list. Directions and A select and play; B goes back.">ゲーム内の一覧から、方向入力とAで選択・再生、Bで戻ります。</p>
        <button id="replay" class="primary launch" data-en="Open replay list">リプレイ一覧を開く</button><p class="subtle" data-en="Online matches are saved automatically.">オンライン対戦は自動保存されます。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page hidden" id="page-controller">
      <div class="page-heading"><h2 data-en="Controller settings">コントローラ設定</h2></div>
      <p id="controller-game-hint" class="subtle" data-en="You can also configure controls in-game with F4.">ゲーム内でも F4 でコントローラを設定できます。</p>
      <div class="card controller-card">
        <p id="controller-locked" class="subtle hidden" data-en="End the connection or game to edit here. Use F4 while in-game.">ここで変更するには接続・ゲームを終了してください。ゲーム内では F4 で設定できます。</p>
        <fieldset id="controller-fields">
          <div class="tabs" role="tablist"><button id="controller-p1" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="active">1P</button><button id="controller-p2" role="tab" aria-selected="false">2P</button></div>
          <div class="row"><label class="grow"><span data-en="Input device">使用する機器</span><select id="controller-device"><option value="">--</option></select></label><button id="controller-refresh" class="quiet" data-en="Refresh devices">機器を再検出</button></div>
          <p id="controller-status" class="subtle" role="status"></p>
          <p class="subtle" data-en="Click a binding, then press a key or press and release a controller input. Changes are saved automatically. Reusing an input clears its previous binding.">割当欄をクリックして、キーを押すかパッドの入力を押して離してください。変更は自動保存され、同じ入力の以前の割当は解除されます。</p>
          <p id="controller-disconnected" class="error-text hidden" data-en="Connect your device and refresh. The saved bindings are kept.">機器を接続して再検出してください。保存済みの割当は保持されています。</p>
          <div id="controller-bindings"></div>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="controller-feedback"><p id="controller-capture-hint" class="subtle hidden" data-en="Release all inputs first. Esc cancels. F1 / F3 / F4 / F8 are reserved.">いったんすべての入力を離してください。Escで中止。F1 / F3 / F4 / F8 は操作用です。</p><button id="controller-cancel" class="quiet hidden" data-en="Cancel input">入力を中止</button></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="page hidden" id="page-settings"><div class="page-heading settings-heading"><h2 data-en="Profile &amp; settings">プロフィール・設定</h2><button id="settings-back" data-page="matching" class="quiet" data-en="Back to matching">マッチングに戻る</button></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Player profile">プレイヤー情報</h3><p id="profile-locked" class="subtle hidden" data-en="End standby and any connection to change your name or image.">名前と画像を変えるには、待機・接続を終了してください。</p><fieldset id="profile-fields"><label><span data-en="Player name">プレイヤー名</span><input id="player-name" maxlength="31" autocomplete="off" /></label><p class="subtle" data-en="Up to 31 ASCII characters. Saved when you leave the field.">半角英数字・記号31文字まで。入力欄を離れると保存します。</p><div class="row"><img id="emblem" width="96" height="48" aria-label="エンブレム" src="emblem:0" /><div class="grow"><button id="emblem-choose" data-en="Choose image">画像を選ぶ</button><button id="emblem-remove" class="quiet" data-en="Remove image">画像を削除</button><p class="subtle" data-en="24 x 12 px, 24-bit uncompressed BMP. Saved automatically.">24×12px・24bit・非圧縮BMP。選ぶと自動保存します。</p></div></div><details id="emblem-preset-details"><summary id="emblem-preset-toggle" data-en="Flag presets (24)">国旗プリセット（24種類）</summary><div class="details-body"><p class="subtle" data-en="Select a flag to use it as your player image.">選んだ国旗をプレイヤー画像にします。</p><div id="emblem-presets"></div></div></details></fieldset><p id="profile-error" class="error-text hidden" data-en="Could not load the saved emblem.">保存済みエンブレムを読み込めませんでした。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Connection">接続</h3><label><span data-en="Connection priority">接続方式の優先</span><select id="connection-preference"><option value="0" data-en="Automatic (LAN / IPv6 / IPv4)">自動（LAN／IPv6／IPv4）</option><option value="1" data-en="Prefer IPv4">IPv4優先</option><option value="2" data-en="Prefer IPv6">IPv6優先</option></select></label><label class="check"><input id="allow-spectators" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Allow spectators">観戦を許可する</span></label><p class="subtle" data-en="Both players must allow watching. Change this before requesting a match.">観戦には双方の許可が必要です。申し込み前に変更してください。</p><details><summary data-en="Notification service" class="summary">通知サービス</summary><label><span>ntfy</span><input id="ntfy-server" type="text" maxlength="255" /></label><button id="save-server" data-en="Save server">通知先を保存</button></details></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Extra colors">エクストラカラー</h3><label class="check"><input id="show-opponent-extra-colors" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Show opponent's extra colors">相手のエクストラカラーを表示する</span></label><p class="subtle" data-en="When off, do not receive the opponent's colors and display their original standard color. You can still use your own extra colors; your opponent controls whether to see them.">OFFでは相手のカラーデータを受信せず、元の標準色で表示します。自分のエクストラカラーは常に使用でき、相手側での表示は相手の設定に従います。</p><p class="subtle" data-en="Change this before starting a match or standby.">対戦・待ち受けの開始前に変更してください。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Incoming notifications">着信通知</h3><label class="check"><input id="sound" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Play notification sound">通知音を鳴らす</span></label><label class="check"><input id="flash" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Flash taskbar button">タスクバーを点滅</span></label><label class="check"><input id="popup" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Show desktop popup">画面の隅に通知を表示</span></label><button id="test-notification" data-en="Test notification">通知を試す</button></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Display">表示</h3><label class="check"><input id="software-rendering" type="checkbox" /><span data-en="Use CPU rendering on next launch">次回起動からCPUで描画する</span></label><p class="subtle" data-en="If the screen is blank, press F8 to switch to CPU rendering.">画面が映らないときは、F8でCPU描画へ切り替えられます。</p><span id="renderer-status" class="pill"></span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="page hidden" id="page-guide">
      <div class="page-heading"><h2 data-en="How to play">操作ガイド</h2></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Getting started">はじめに</h3>
        <p data-en="For non-Steam MBAACC 1.07 Rev.1.4.0. Place both cccaster_B and GRP from the ZIP beside MBAA.exe. Keep existing settings.">対応：非Steam版MBAACC 1.07 Rev.1.4.0。ZIPのcccaster_BとGRPをMBAA.exeの隣へ配置し、既存設定は保持してください。</p>
        <p data-en="Start Training and press F4 to set up your controller.">まずトレーニングを起動し、F4でコントローラを設定してください。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Matching">対戦の始め方</h3>
        <p data-en="Select a player in Public matching and send a request. To host, start public standby and accept an incoming request.">公開一覧から相手を選んで申し込みます。自分で募集するときは公開待機を始め、届いた申し込みを承諾してください。</p>
        <p data-en="To play with someone you know, enter their code in Direct connection. Leave it blank to host, then share your code.">知り合いと遊ぶときは「直接接続」に相手のコードを入力します。自分で待つときは空欄で開始し、表示されたコードを相手に送ってください。</p>
        <p data-en="Matching returns to standby with the same code after a match. Use End standby to remove your listing.">マッチングは対戦後も同じコードで待受へ戻ります。募集を終えるときは「待機を終了」を押してください。</p>
        <p data-en="Names are not verified identities. Decline unwanted requests. If a listing remains after a connection failure, restart and use Cancel leftover listings.">表示名は本人確認済みではありません。不要な申し込みは断ってください。通信障害で自分の募集が残ったときは、再起動後に「残った自分の募集を取り消す」を使ってください。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Game controls">ゲーム中の操作</h3><div class="tips">
        <p><kbd>F4</kbd><span data-en="Controller settings. Changes save immediately; press again to close.">コントローラ設定。変更はその都度保存し、もう一度押すと閉じます。</span></p>
        <p><kbd>A / B</kbd><span data-en="Confirm / back with your assigned buttons. B is disabled before selecting a character.">割り当てたボタンで決定／戻る。キャラ未選択時のBは無効です。</span></p>
        <p><kbd>Ctrl + 0–8</kbd><span data-en="Change input delay at character select or during offline practice.">キャラ選択中・オフライン練習中の入力ディレイを変更。</span></p>
        <p><kbd>F1</kbd><span data-en="Cycle normal / detailed / hidden display. Training, spectating and replay include a frame bar in detailed mode.">情報表示を通常／詳細／非表示に切替。練習・観戦・リプレイの詳細表示にはフレームバーがあります。</span></p>
        <p><kbd>FN1 / FN2</kbd><span data-en="Training: save / load a practice state.">練習状態の保存／読込み。</span></p>
        <p><kbd data-en="Left / Right + FN2">左 / 右 + FN2</kbd><span data-en="Normal training: put the opponent at that corner. Keep the saved state.">通常の練習：相手を指定した側の壁際へ配置。保存状態は保持します。</span></p>
        <p><kbd>Alt + Enter</kbd><span data-en="Toggle fullscreen.">全画面表示の切替。</span></p>
      </div>
        <details id="practice-guide"><summary id="practice-guide-toggle" data-en="Practice save / load details">練習の保存・読込みの詳細</summary><div class="details-body">
          <p data-en="Assign FN1 and FN2 in F4 settings. FN1 saves once and freezes both characters while held; release to resume.">FN1・FN2はF4で割り当てます。FN1は状態を1回保存し、押している間は両キャラを停止、離すと再開します。</p>
          <p data-en="FN2 loads after a reset, or resets normally if nothing is saved. DUMMY loads directly; recording loads and restarts recording.">FN2はリセット後に読込み、保存がなければ通常リセットします。ダミーは直接読込み、録画中は読み込んで録り直します。</p>
          <p data-en="There is one temporary save slot, cleared when you leave battle.">保存は一時的な1枠です。戦闘を離れると消去されます。</p>
        </div></details>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="After a match">対戦後</h3>
        <p data-en="Both players choose ONCE AGAIN to rematch. Either player choosing CHARACTER SELECT returns both players to character select.">双方がONCE AGAINを選ぶと再戦。片側がCHARACTER SELECTを選ぶと、双方がキャラ選択に戻ります。</p>
        <p data-en="Matches are saved automatically to ReplayVS once the result is confirmed. Player images are not stored in replays.">結果が確定するとReplayVSへ自動保存します。プレイヤー画像はリプレイに保存されません。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><h3 data-en="Connection help">接続できないとき</h3>
        <p data-en="Check the code and the other player’s standby state. Spectating requires both players’ permission and a reachable TCP connection; it ends when the match connection closes.">コードと相手の待機状態を確認してください。観戦には対戦者双方の許可とTCP接続が必要です。対戦の接続が終了すると観戦も終了します。</p>
        <p data-en="Your opponent can see your IP address. Expand Detailed session log below when troubleshooting.">接続相手にIPアドレスが伝わります。不具合の確認には、画面下の「接続の詳細ログ」を開いてください。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="session-card" class="card session-card hidden" aria-label="接続状況"><div class="card-title"><h3 data-en="Session">接続状況</h3><span id="session-badge" class="pill"></span></div><p id="session-status" role="status"></p><div id="share-code" class="code-line hidden"><strong id="session-code" class="code"></strong><button id="copy-session" data-en="Copy code">コードをコピー</button></div><button id="copy-watch" data-en="Copy spectator code" class="hidden">観戦コードをコピー</button><details id="manual" class="hidden"><summary data-en="Manual code exchange" class="summary">手動コード交換</summary><p class="subtle" data-en="Send the host code to the guest; return the guest’s reply to the host.">募集側のコードを参加者へ送り、参加者の返信コードを募集側へ返してください。</p><textarea id="manual-code" readonly="" rows="3"></textarea><button id="copy-manual" data-en="Copy manual code">手動コードをコピー</button><div id="manual-host"><label><span data-en="Guest reply">参加側の返信コード</span><input id="manual-peer" maxlength="400" spellcheck="false" /></label><button id="use-reply" data-en="Connect with reply">返信コードで接続</button></div><button id="manual-start" data-en="Start manual connection together">タイミングを合わせて手動接続を開始</button></details><button id="cancel-session" data-en="Cancel connection / standby">接続・待機をキャンセル</button></section>
    <details id="log-details" class="log-details"><summary data-en="Detailed session log" class="summary">接続の詳細ログ</summary><div class="details-body"><div id="routes" class="subtle"></div><pre id="session-log"></pre></div></details>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
